    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;North America’s premiere Billy Joel tribute concert experience featuring a look-a-like and sound-a-like performance by Elton Lammie, who is one of the continents finest award-winning vocalists, and an accomplished multi-instrumentalist who has mastered more than 10 instruments. He is the winner of dozens of awards for his vocal skills, including two nationwide vocal competitions.&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
